# Technical Stack



Mobile: 
- Flutter (Dart 3.x)
- Plugins: camera, image_picker, flutter_image_crop

Backend:
- Node.js (Express) hosted on Cloud Run

Authentication:
- Firebase Auth (OAuth2 & JWT)

Data Storage:
- Firestore (NoSQL) or Cloud SQL (PostgreSQL)

Vision Integration:
- Google Cloud Vision via REST (OBJECT_LOCALIZATION, PRODUCT_SEARCH)

Infrastructure as Code:
- Terraform (GCP resources)

CI/CD:
- GitHub Actions → Cloud Build → Cloud Run

Monitoring & Logging:
- Google Cloud Monitoring & Logging
- Sentry for client‑side error tracking
